00:33:55.000 --> 00:34:02.500
over directly to the Stackdriver
page under Ops Logging Console

00:34:02.500 --> 00:34:04.210
and get access to a
ton of information

00:34:04.210 --> 00:34:09.670
about how things are doing as
well as take a look, again,

00:34:09.670 --> 00:34:13.730
at the logs but with control
over how you want to filter,

00:34:13.730 --> 00:34:15.219
what you want to know.

00:34:15.219 --> 00:34:19.420
Let's see my
container logs, which

00:34:19.420 --> 00:34:24.090
are in the default namespace
for my main containers.

00:34:27.250 --> 00:34:31.810
And maybe I want to
watch some streaming.

00:34:31.810 --> 00:34:38.190
OK, so let's go back
here to the repo.

00:34:41.040 --> 00:34:43.081
This is where you want to go.

00:34:43.081 --> 00:34:43.664
There's a lab.

00:34:47.648 --> 00:34:51.070
These are all the steps to be
